  "heat_west_only": "中",
  "muggy_west_only": "強",
  "heat_muggy_west_evidence": "[おぎはら/品種] 耐暑性；強\n[MBG/種] Appreciates some afternoon shade in hot summer climates such as St.\n[NC State/種] It grows in full sun or partial shade and appreciates some afternoon shade on hot summer days, but cannot grow in full shade.\n[Walters/品種] Tolerates heat and humidity.\n[食い違い] 欧米の文献（品種・種の記述）は 中 相当。おぎはら植物園の値を採った\n[RHS/品種] Aspect: East-facing or South-facing",
  "spread_evidence": "[地下茎 3／NC State・種] Plumbago is an aggressively spreading, low, herbaceous perennial ground cover and a member of the thrift family (Plumbaginaceae).\n[地下茎の食い違い] Gaißmayer は 2 相当、MBG は 2 相当、stauden.de は 2 相当",
  "mixing_evidence": "地下茎かこぼれ種が 3（こぼれ種・地下茎の根拠の列）",
